- DSH `0.2.1-rc.2` (tested target), Node `>=22.19` with native `node:sqlite`.
- For `hybrid`, one embedding provider:
  - an existing local TensorRT manager (default `http://127.0.0.1:8110`);
  - a Google Gemini API key;
  - an OpenRouter API key;
  - an OpenAI-compatible embeddings endpoint and model.
- No SDKs or extra vector database are required.

The browser client adds a **Skill discovery** section with:

- mode selector;
- provider, model, environment-variable reference and dimensions;
- **Refresh embedding models** (embedding-capable models only);
- **Test connection** using synthetic text, never your skills;
- **Preview data sent** before a rebuild;
- explicit consent review, rebuild progress and cancel;
- visible keyword-fallback status.
